  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/soul-fire-d/banner.png\" alt=\"Soul Fire'd 橫幅\"></p><hr><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/minecraft.svg\" alt=\"Minecraft\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d/files?version=26.1&amp;version=26.1.2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/26-1-x.svg\" alt=\"26.1.x\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔線\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d/files?version=1.21.11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-11.svg\" alt=\"1.21.11\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔線\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d/files?version=1.21.10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-10.svg\" alt=\"1.21.10\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔線\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d/files?version=1.21.8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-8.svg\" alt=\"1.21.8\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔線\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d/files?version=1.21.7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-7.svg\" alt=\"1.21.7\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔線\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d/files?version=1.21.6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-6.svg\" alt=\"1.21.6\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔線\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d/files?version=1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-1.svg\" alt=\"1.21.1\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔線\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d/files?version=1.21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21.svg\" alt=\"1.21\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/loader.svg\" alt=\"載入器\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d/files?gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/neoforge.svg\" alt=\"NeoForge\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔線\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d/files?gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/fabric.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/side/client-server.svg\" alt=\"覆蓋層\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/issues.svg\" alt=\"問題回報\"><a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/soul-fire-d/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p><hr><h2>📝 <strong>描述</strong></h2><p>是否曾注意到 Minecraft 中的靈魂火看起來獨特，但行為卻與一般火焰無異？<strong>Soul Fire'd</strong> 修正了這點，讓靈魂火的行為完全符合你的期待！</p><p>此模組確保<strong>靈魂火擁有獨特的行為</strong>，包括特殊的傷害效果、自訂附魔等等。</p><blockquote>\n  <p>⚠️ <strong>重要</strong>：Soul Fire'd 必須安裝在<strong>客戶端與伺服器端</strong>，因為它引入了實質的遊戲機制變化，而非僅是視覺效果。</p>\n</blockquote><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraftstorage.com%252fmods%252fsoul-fired%253fref%253dcrystal-nest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/soul-fire-d/minecraft-storage-banner.png\" alt=\"Minecraft Storage\"></a></p><h2>✨ <strong>特色</strong></h2><ul>\n<li><p>🔵 <strong>靈魂火覆蓋層</strong><br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/soul-fire-d/overlay.gif\" alt=\"覆蓋層\"><br>\n<em>偏好較薄的版本？請參考 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/slim-fire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Slim Fire</a>！</em></p></li>\n<li><p>🔥 <strong>一致的靈魂火傷害</strong><br>\n被靈魂火燒到的實體會呈現藍色火焰，每秒受到 2 點傷害。<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/soul-fire-d/sheep.gif\" alt=\"羊\"></p></li>\n<li><p>🎯 <strong>一致的靈魂火機制</strong><br>\n例如（但不限於）殭屍被靈魂火燃燒，以及箭矢穿過靈魂火後可使目標著火。<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/soul-fire-d/arrow.gif\" alt=\"箭矢\"></p></li>\n<li><p>📚 <strong>新增附魔：靈魂火焰附加 與 靈魂火焰。</strong><br>\n類似於火焰附加與火焰附魔，但改為施加靈魂火，造成額外傷害。<br>\n這兩種附魔皆可高度自訂，可啟用（預設）或停用等。<br>\n<em>從 <code>1.21</code 版本開始，設定透過資料包進行。</em></p></li>\n</ul><h2>🤝 <strong>相容性</strong></h2><p>已完全整合 Soul Fire'd 的模組：</p><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">模組</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">載入器</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tetra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tetra</a> 搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tetracelium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tetracelium</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/decorative-blocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Decorative Blocks</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs-interaction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Mobs Interaction</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amendments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Amendments</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/infernal-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Infernal Expansion</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p>希望你的模組也出現在這裡？請<a href=\"https://github.com/Crystal-Nest/soul-fire-d/issues/new?assignees=Crystal-Spider&amp;labels=question,medium priority&amp;projects=&amp;template=information_request.yml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此提交問題</a>並提供你的模組連結！</p><h2>🔗 <strong>相依性</strong></h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">模組</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">載入器</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">需求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobweb</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">必要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/promehteus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Prometheus</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">必要</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2>📜 <strong>許可證與使用權利</strong></h2><p>歡迎在任何模組包或影片中使用此模組，只需標示出處，最好能連結到<a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/soul-fire-d#readme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。<br>\n本專案採用 <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/soul-fire-d/blob/master/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crystal Nest 社群許可證 v1</a> 發布。</p><h2>💻 <strong>給開發者</strong></h2><p>自 <strong>v6.0.0</strong> 起，API 已移至 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/prometheus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Prometheus</a>。\n透過詳細文件學習如何整合自訂火焰類型並使用提供的 API：</p><ul>\n<li>📖 <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/prometheus/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">API Wiki</a></li>\n<li>📘 <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/prometheus/wiki/Data-Driven-Fires\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">資料包整合 Wiki</a></li>\n</ul><h2>❤️ <strong>支援我們</strong></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrystalnest.it%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Crystal Nest 網站\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/crystal-nest/pic512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/BP6EdBfAmt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/discord/discord512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/crystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/patreon/patreon512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcrystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Ko-fi\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/kofi/kofi512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/Crystal-Nest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"我們的其他專案\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fcrystal-nest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/modrinth/modrinth512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/crystalspider/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/curseforge/curseforge512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fcrystalspider\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/d559b544-474c-4109-b861-1b2e6ca6026a.webp\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting\"></a></p>",
